  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting and Advancing Language Rights in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of a larger social inclusion program and aims to foster social inclusion by enhancing the learning of official languages for citizens and institutions. Its overall objective is to create an enabling environment that promotes equal use of official languages.</narrative>
